		(property "Description" "2.2k I2C pull-up. I=(Vrail-VOL)/R; at 3.3V and VOL=0.4V, 1.32mA. For a 300ns limit and +5% R, RC 30-70% rise permits <=153pF. Verify receiver VOL, real capacitance, any parallel pull-ups and configured bus timing; not a universal 400kHz approval."
